{"about_the_game":"<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2203590/extras/banner_no_text.png?t=1738193414\" /><br><br><strong>Congratulations!</strong> You've been accepted as a participant in a new TV show! You'll be living with 7 strangers for a month and romance is <i>strongly</i> encouraged!<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2203590/extras/ep5part2ayaka1sex.gif?t=1738193414\" /><br><br><i>Tune in to the show</i> is an adult visual novel focusing on characters, story, romance, and sex. At the same time, it doesn't take itself <i>too</i> seriously. Apart from the very first one, all of the sex scenes in the game can be avoided with specific dialogue options, so you can choose if you want to romance all of the love interests, just one of them, or any combination at all. <strong>HINT</strong>: The game won't punish you for pursuing all of the ladies ;)<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2203590/extras/ep4daeun2hand.gif?t=1738193414\" /><br><br>As of right now (Episode 8), the game features:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> over 5,100 renders<br></li><li> 123 animations<br></li><li> 13 in-game days<br></li><li> 62 Steam achievements<br></li><li> 59 music tracks.</li></ul><br>The size of the game will keep on growing with each new update.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2203590/extras/ep5vivian3fuck.gif?t=1738193414\" /><br><br>The setting of a TV show makes it easier for you to get to know all of the lovely participants as you'll get paired up with them for various missions throughout the month. Sounds almost too good to be true? Well, thinking about it, some things about this show <i>are</i> pretty suspicious, aren't they? You might want to look into that.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai